spice
* Components
I_nRD 4 5 DC ; Current source from net 4 to net 5
I_n1 8 3 DC ; Current source from net 8 to net 3
V_DD 4 0 DC ; Voltage source from net 4 to ground

* Resistor
R_D 4 5 ; Resistor RD between net 4 and net 5

* NMOS Transistor
M1 5 6 3 3 NMOS ; NMOS with drain at net 5, gate at net 6, source and body at net 3

* Connections
V_b 6 0 DC ; Bias voltage connected to the gate of M1
